      "lines": [
        "振动迅速消失。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "为了消除汽车沿着不平的道路行驶时车厢的振动，汽车",
        "上装有专门的减振器。车厢振动时与其相联的活塞，在充满",
        "液体的缸内移动。液体通过活塞上专门的油孔流出，从而产",
        "生很大的阻力，迫使振动很快停止。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "问题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "1",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "1. 在振动频率增加 $1$ 倍时，速度和加速度的振幅各增加",
        "多少倍？假设位移振幅不变。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "2",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "2. 简谐振动中当物体位移减少时，速度和加速度怎样",
        "变化？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "3",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "3. 带摆的钟在夏天还是在冬天走得较快？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "4",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "4. 为什么弹簧上的物体振动频率与其质量无关？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "5",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "5. 两个摆的球，半径相同而质量不同，悬挂在等长的绳",
        "子上。问其中哪一个摆的振动阻尼较快：是轻的还是重的？"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "13. 受迫振动"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "自由振动不论时间怎样长最终总要消失。因此在实践中",
        "很少应用。非阻尼振动具有重要的实际意义，这种振动能够",
        "延续任意长的时间。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "激起非阻尼振动最简单的方法是用周期性的外力作用于",
        "系统。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "**在周期性外力的作用下进行的振动，称为受迫振动。**"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "外力对系统所作的功，保证能量从外部传给系统。使系",
        "统尽管有摩擦力的作用，但振动不会衰减。"
      ]
    },
    {
